# Response headers for static assets (Cloudflare Workers static assets). The build adds a
# long-lived Cache-Control rule for /_astro/* to this file, and the security headers: a
# catch-all /* rule first and the /cms and /cms/* rules last (CSP, COOP, X-Robots-Tag and
# Referrer-Policy for the CMS), generated from src/utils/staticSecurityHeaders.ts by
# src/integrations/securityHeaders.ts. Cloudflare keys rules by path (a second rule for a
# path replaces the first), so don't add rules for /*, /cms or /cms/* here: the build fails
# if you do. See docs/security.md.
